Jev-Mem: System-One Controlled Agentic Memory

This project is derived from MAGMA, the Multi-Graph based Agentic Memory
Architecture: https://github.com/FredJiang0324/MAGMA

The upstream MIT license and its original copyright notice are preserved in
LICENSE. Jev-Mem adds a TypeSafe Jev control layer, bounded retrieval,
evaluation support, and supporting documentation. These modifications are
distributed under the same MIT license. This repository is not an official
release of MAGMA or TypeSafe and does not imply their endorsement.

Jev and the TypeSafe SDK are external services/software with their own terms
and licenses. LoCoMo and LongMemEval datasets are not redistributed here;
obtain them from their original distributors and follow their terms.
